      "message": "the reporter says in the bug \"The choice of formatting files should be separate from the choice of submitting a CL.\"\n\nthis CL feels like it\u0027s overloading flags and not really addressing the problem. `--ignore-hooks` implies no fix, while `--yes` implies fix. why not go with the reporter\u0027s suggestion and add a `--fix` flag independent of `--yes` and `--ignore-hooks`?",
